#X text 380 220 Left: a triangle wave read with the signal \, 1 - 4 * abs(wrap(x / 4 + 0.25) - 0.5). Inside -1..1 it changes nothing. Middle: the same fold through a sine \, sin(x * pi / 2). Symmetry shifts the signal before the fold. What it alone would give is taken off after it \, so silence stays silence.;
